   "subject": "Curious behaviour when @include files (for the first time) using devtools::document() - possibly related to collate entry in DESCRIPTION file",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve been experiencing an apparently intermittent problem with load_all() and document() appearing to be unhappy with, or happy with my R code, depending on what  had done earlier.</div><div><br></div><div>I have finally managed to reproduce what causes the behaviour, and have done so in the sequence of 3 successive editions of the same baby package (collateexample) which I have attached.  Now I know what&#39;s happening I can work round it, but I think it is probably not what should be happening, so I&#39;ll report my experience here, in the hope it&#39;s useful.</div><div><br></div><div>The baby package has 3 files (and the names of the files are important to reproducing the behaviour! that&#39;s what made it hard to discover in my real project).</div><div><br></div><div>file x-code.r defines and documents a generic function (gen1)</div><div>file a-code.r defines and documents a method for the gen1.  The @include x-code.r tag is at the top of a-code.r</div><div>file y-code.r does nothing at all.  It just contains an @include x-code.r tag as part of a trick to make load_all() and document() happy (eventually).</div><div><br></div><div>When I first try to run this I get the following output:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> load_all</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Loading</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample<br> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Show</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Traceback</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br> <br> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Rerun</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">with</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Debug</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Error</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> setMethod</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;gen1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> signature </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">def</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#12) : </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">no</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> existing definition </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">‘</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">’</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span></div></code></div><p><br></p><div>This version of the code is in collateexample.1.zip.</div><div><br></div><div>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div><br></div><div>If however I remove a-code.r (or just rename it temporarily to a-code.r.old)</div><div><br></div><div>I can then successfully run load_all() and document().</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">document</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Updating</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample documentation<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Loading</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">First</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> time </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">using</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> roxygen2 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Upgrading</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> automatically</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">...</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Updating</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collate directive </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  C</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Users</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Geoff</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Python</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> working copy</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Map</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> morphing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">DESCRIPTION <br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> NAMESPACE<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Rd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Rd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div>If I look at the documentation that has been created I get  </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> dev_help</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gen1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  R </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Documentation</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r gen1<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r description gen1<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Usage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Details</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r details gen1</span></div></code></div><div><br>The existence of the y-code.r file is important.  It causes the DESCRIPTION file to be updated with a collate directive, as follows</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Collate</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;collateexample-package.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;x-code.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;y-code.r&#39;</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>This edition of my package is stored in collateexample.2.zip</div><div><br></div><div>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div><br></div><div>Now if I go back and replace (or rename) a-code.r I can successfully load_all() and document() my package.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> document</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Updating</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample documentation<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Loading</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Adding</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> files missing </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collate</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Updating</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collate directive </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  C</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Users</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Geoff</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Python</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> working copy</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Map</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> morphing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">\\</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">DESCRIPTION <br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> NAMESPACE<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Rd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Writing</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Rd</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div><br></div><div>When I look at the documentation that has been generated, it isn&#39;t quite in the order I expected, (the documentation of the method appears before the documentation from the generic function) - but at least it is there</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> dev_help</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;gen1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">method </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">collateexample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  R </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Documentation</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Description</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r description gen1 method<br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r description gen1<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Usage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">## S4 method for signature &#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>gen1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Details</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r details gen1 method<br>file </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r details gen1<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Methods</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">by</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">class</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>numeric</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">This</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">is</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a method </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> gen1 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">from</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> file a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">code</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>For completeness here is the collate: directive from DESCRIPTION file after this step</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Collate</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;x-code.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;a-code.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;collateexample-package.r&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;y-code.r&#39;</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>This edition of my package is stored in collateexample.3.zip.<br><br></div><div>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div><br></div><div>Hope that :</div><div>a) I&#39;m not doing something stupid, and</div><div>b) if I&#39;m not, that this helps track down what&#39;s happening vis a vis what should be happening.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards</div><div><br></div><div>Geoff</div><div><br></div><div>PS If I should be recording these types of things on gitHub not here let me know.  I haven&#39;t learnt git or gitHub yet, but suspect doing so should be on my to do list.<br></div></div>"
    ]
